    "updated_at": "2025-08-24T19:33:54Z",
    "body": "Indeed, piping to a writable stream with HWM 0 (or piping through a transform stream with writable HWM 0) stalls progress indefinitely. 🙁\n\nUnfortunately, we don't have a solution for this yet, see #1158. For transform streams, I have a proposal in #1190 that would solve it quite cleanly, but for writable streams it's a bit more involved.",
